#. 負け……！？
msgctxt "0001 | CELES"
msgid "I...lost?"
msgstr ""

#. 負け…だなんて…！
msgctxt "0002 | CELES"
msgid "I lost...!?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな言葉を聞いたのは…いつ以来でしょう…
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid ""
"When was the last time...I was forced to utter such\n"
"words?"
msgstr ""

#. 重い…言葉ですわね……
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid "They hang heavy around my neck..."
msgstr ""

#. 認めるんだね？　キミが犯人だって事を…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then you admit it? You're the killer?"
msgstr ""

#. うふ…ふ…嫌ですわ…
#. キミだなんて…そんな教授みたいな口ぶり…
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Hm. Heh... Listen to you, trying to take charge. As if\n"
"you're my private instructor..."
msgstr ""

#. セレスティア・ルーデンベルク…
#. いえ、もしくは…
msgctxt "0007 | CELES"
msgid "I, Celestia Ludenberg—actually, no..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>安広多恵子<CLT>…でいいですわ。
msgctxt "0008 | CELES"
msgid "<CLT 3>Taeko Yasuhiro<CLT> is fine..."
msgstr ""

#. 安広多恵子…？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Taeko...?"
msgstr ""

#. ようやく…認めたか…
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So, you've finally accepted it."
msgstr ""

#. 負けを宣告されてあがくほど、
#. 往生際は悪くありませんの。
msgctxt "0011 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I'm the kind of person, once I've lost, I don't like\n"
"things to drag on."
msgstr ""

#. そうか……
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Interesting..."
msgstr ""

#. モノクマさん、それでは始めてくださる？
msgctxt "0013 | CELES"
msgid "Okay, Monokuma. I'm ready to begin."
msgstr ""

#. いえ……
msgctxt "0014 | CELES"
msgid "Or, no..."
msgstr ""

#. 終わらせてくださる…ですわね？
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid "I suppose this is the end, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. ふむふむ…
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hmm. Hmm."
msgstr ""

#. お待ちかねの投票ターイム！　ですねッ！？
#. いいでしょう、では始めましょうか！
msgctxt "0017 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It is indeed the moment we've all been waiting for!\n"
"Time to vote! Okay? Okay!"
msgstr ""

#. では、オマエラは、
#. お手元のスイッチで投票してくださーい！
msgctxt "0018 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If you would, please locate your lever and cast your\n"
"vote!"
msgstr ""

#. さぁて…投票の結果クロとなるのは誰なのか？
msgctxt "0019 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And when the votes are tallied...who will become the\n"
"blackened!?"
msgstr ""

#. その答えは…正解なのか不正解なのかーーッ！？
#. さぁ、どうなんだーーッ！？
msgctxt "0020 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Will you make the right choice, or the dreadfully\n"
"wrong one? What's it gonna be? What's it gonna beeee!?"
msgstr ""
